== In popular culture ==
Dark matter regularly appears as a topic in hybrid periodicals that cover both factual scientific topics and science fiction,<ref>
{{cite journal
 |last=Cramer |first=John G.
 |date=1 July 2003 
 |title=LSST – the dark matter telescope
